{"nodes": [{"id": "deploy_checklist", "label": "SkinLedger deploy checklist", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_auth_secret", "label": "AUTH_SECRET production env var", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must be generated per-deployment (openssl rand -base64 32) rather than reused from dev, since it keys session/JWT signing."}, {"id": "deploy_database_url", "label": "DATABASE_URL must point at Postgres in prod", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SQLite is a dev-only convenience; production targets managed Postgres (Neon/Supabase) for durability, backups and concurrent serverless connections."}, {"id": "deploy_auth_url", "label": "AUTH_URL pins public base URL", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:7-10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With trustHost: true and no AUTH_URL, the callback/redirect base URL is derived from the Host header, so a forged 'Host: evil.com' hijacks it. Setting AUTH_URL also pins the scheme regardless of whether the proxy sets x-forwarded-proto."}, {"id": "deploy_trust_proxy", "label": "TRUST_PROXY=true behind a trusted proxy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:11-16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without it every client collapses onto the rate-limit key \"unknown\". That is fail-closed against IP spoofing, but it means one attacker can block registration for everyone with 5 requests/hour (and login at ~30/min). Behind a proxy that rewrites x-forwarded-for with the real IP, limits go back to per-IP. See src/lib/client-ip.ts."}, {"id": "deploy_client_ip_module", "label": "src/lib/client-ip.ts (client IP resolution)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_postgres_migration", "label": "Switch prisma/schema.prisma provider to postgresql", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:20-22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provider swap must be paired with the matching @prisma/adapter-* driver adapter, then `npx prisma migrate deploy` applied against prod."}, {"id": "deploy_import_catalog", "label": "npm run import:catalog (populate ~33k item catalog)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:23-24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Catalog is imported rather than migrated as seed data: ~33k skins, stickers, agents, cases/capsules/containers, charms, patches, graffiti, music kits and collectibles come from an external source and change over time."}, {"id": "deploy_rate_limit_shared_store", "label": "Replace in-memory rate limiter with shared store", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:28-32", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/lib/rate-limit.ts keeps counters in process memory, which are not shared between serverless instances. Before horizontal scaling this must move to a shared store (a Postgres table or Upstash Redis) or the limit degrades proportionally to instance count."}, {"id": "deploy_authjs_dependency_risk", "label": "Auth.js beta dependency risk (next-auth@5.0.0-beta.*)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:36-39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Authentication rests on a beta release: the API breaks between betas, no security-patch SLA is promised, and npm audit gives no signal for it. Therefore the Auth.js changelog must be re-read before every upgrade."}, {"id": "deploy_npm_audit_findings", "label": "npm audit findings triaged as unreachable", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:40-44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "sharp is pulled in via next but next/image is unused; postcss is build-only; @hono/node-server is Prisma dev tooling. Explicitly do NOT run `npm audit fix --force` \u2014 it proposes next@9.3.3, a seven-major downgrade."}, {"id": "deploy_xlsx_cdn_sheetjs", "label": "xlsx sourced from SheetJS CDN, not npm", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:46-49", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The npm copy of xlsx is frozen at 0.18.5 with an unfixed high-severity prototype-pollution issue, so package.json points at https://cdn.sheetjs.com/...tgz. Consequence: the build host needs network access to cdn.sheetjs.com at npm install time, and upgrades must also come from the CDN."}, {"id": "deploy_support_contact", "label": "Add a real support contact before release", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:53-57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Error pages (src/components/error-fallback.tsx, src/app/global-error.tsx) and the footer already say 'contact support' but no channel exists, so the Report button and /forgot-password lead nowhere."}, {"id": "deploy_security_headers", "label": "Security headers in next.config.ts (CSP/HSTS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:58-59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Already configured; remaining check is that CSP img-src covers the current Steam CDN domains, otherwise item images silently break."}, {"id": "deploy_catalog_autoupdate", "label": "Weekly GitHub Action catalog refresh", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:60-61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A weekly action running import:catalog against the prod DB must also bust the index cache, since getSkinFamilies has a 1-hour TTL and would otherwise serve stale families."}, {"id": "deploy_getskinfamilies_cache", "label": "getSkinFamilies index cache (TTL 1h)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_vercel_deploy", "target": "deploy_checklist", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_checklist", "target": "deploy_auth_secret", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_checklist", "target": "deploy_database_url", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_checklist", "target": "deploy_auth_url", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_checklist", "target": "deploy_trust_proxy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_trust_proxy", "target": "deploy_client_ip_module", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_trust_proxy", "target": "deploy_rate_limit_shared_store", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:11-32", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_client_ip_module", "target": "deploy_rate_limit_shared_store", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_auth_url", "target": "deploy_authjs_dependency_risk", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_auth_secret", "target": "deploy_authjs_dependency_risk", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_database_url", "target": "deploy_postgres_migration", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:6-22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_postgres_migration", "target": "deploy_import_catalog", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:20-24", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_catalog_autoupdate", "target": "deploy_import_catalog", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DEPLOY.md", "source_location": "DEPLOY.md:60", "weight": 1.0}, {